{
  title = "the meet carried at a module-set join is its own type";
  adr = "0034, 0039 (den-hoag-k4f4g)";
  what = "`carried-meet-at-a-module-set-is-its-own-type`: a submodule option declared once wrapped by a nixpkgs `addCheck` and once bare is met at the module set, and the record carried there is minted by its constructor over its join and the checks it carries, so it is the same type as itself and as a second declaration of the same pair, a different type from the bare pair, and still refuses what the wrapper's check rejects; before, it carried its join's mark and was refused against itself";
}
